      "answer": "The customer most likely to defect to a cheaper tactical competitor if the next promised milestone is missed is Pioneer Freight Solutions. The exact milestone at risk is the backfill enrichment and recompute of index weights scheduled from 2026-04-12 to 2026-04-30. This milestone is critical because it addresses the taxonomy change incident that degraded search relevance and entity graph linking, increasing manual triage efforts. Missing this milestone risks procurement extending a tactical PoC with the competitor NoiseGuard, which is cheaper and offers quick tactical noise reduction but lacks the deeper schema-aware remediation Pioneer requires [art_7373b64fdfdd].",
